  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A perfectly reflecting mirror of mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> mounted on a spring constitutes a spring-mass system of angular frequency <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> such that <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> as Planck's constant. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> photons of wavelength <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> strike the mirror simultaneously at normal incidence such that the mirror gets displaced by <math><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If the value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is________.<br/>[Consider the spring as massless]<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/58c9d372-ac90-4d89-93a4-545f76d06fe1-image24.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total Momentum transferred on mirror <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> (for perfect reflection)<br />In an <math><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">M</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi></math><br />Where <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo></math> amplitude and <math><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo></math> angular frequency<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi><mi>A</mi></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi><mi>A</mi></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">Ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
